<!-- ================= 01 THE EVOLUTION ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="company">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-num reveal">01 — The Evolution</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">It started with <em>a story.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead reveal d2">In 2014, Humans of Bombay began with a simple belief: stories can change the way people see the world. Twelve years later, that belief has become a company.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="essay">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="first dropcap">Over the next 12 years, we told more than 7,000 stories — stories of ambition, love, loss, resilience, failure, success and everything in between. Along the way, those stories built a community of over 7 million people and gave us something far more valuable than reach: an understanding of people.</p>
        <p>We learned what makes people stop. What makes them feel. What makes them share. What makes an idea stay with them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d1">
        <p>And then brands started coming to us. What began as a storytelling platform evolved into a business helping brands create stories, build communities, develop original IPs and reach audiences at scale.</p>
        <p><em>Today, that business has a name: The Human Company.</em></p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost sec-cta" href="{{ "/company/#journey" | url }}" style="padding-left:0">Our journey <span class="arw">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kicker-facts">
      <div class="kf reveal"><div class="k">12 years</div><div class="v">Of understanding people</div></div>
      <div class="kf reveal d1"><div class="k">7,000+</div><div class="v">Stories told</div></div>
      <div class="kf reveal d2"><div class="k">7M+</div><div class="v">Community built</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

