  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-num reveal">02 — What We Do</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">From the first idea to the <em>final audience.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead reveal d2">Strategy, creative, production, media, creators and entertainment no longer live in separate worlds. The strongest ideas move seamlessly between them — so we built a company that does too.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="belief-list">
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">01</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Strategy</div><div class="bd">Finding the insight, opportunity or cultural tension worth building around.</div></div>
