        <div class="bn">02</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Creative</div><div class="bd">Turning that insight into ideas people actually want to engage with.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">03</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Production</div><div class="bd">Bringing those ideas to life across films, social, digital, podcasts, experiences and everything in between.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">04</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Original IPs</div><div class="bd">Creating formats and franchises that can live beyond a single campaign.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">05</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Distribution</div><div class="bd">Taking ideas to audiences through our own media ecosystem and the wider digital landscape.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="lead reveal" style="margin-top:44px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.2vw,1.8rem);color:var(--ink)">One connected ecosystem. From imagination to impact.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= 03 THE HUMAN ADVANTAGE ================= -->
<section class="sec manifesto night" id="advantage">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="sec-num reveal">03 — The Human Advantage</span>
    <p class="big reveal d1">We didn't learn about people <em>from a deck.</em></p>
    <p class="body reveal d2">We spent 12 years listening to them. From a local train commuter to a global icon. From first-time founders to India's biggest names. From everyday lives to stories that made national headlines. We've sat across thousands of people and learned what makes them tick.</p>

