      <div class="m-stat reveal d3"><div class="k">Distribution</div><div class="v">Is how we make it matter</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= 04 ORIGINAL IPs — SHORT FORM ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="ips">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-num reveal">04 — Original IPs</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">Stories. Formats. Experiences. <em>IPs.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead reveal d2">Our work doesn't fit into one format — and that's the point. We build across platforms, audiences and categories, creating content that can live wherever people are.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="shows">
      <article class="show reveal">
        <div class="ph wide" aria-hidden="true"><b>Series still<br/>16:10</b></div>
        <span class="tag">Short-form</span>
        <h3>4:20 Ki Local</h3>
        <p>Mumbai's realest conversations, captured during the 4:20 PM local rush. Unfiltered opinions, unexpected answers and the debates that inevitably take over the comments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="show reveal d1">
        <div class="ph wide" aria-hidden="true"><b>Series still<br/>16:10</b></div>
        <span class="tag">Short-form</span>
        <h3>Naam To Suna Hoga</h3>
        <p>A journey through Mumbai's iconic legacy restaurants — told through the people, recipes, stories and generations behind them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="show reveal d2">
        <div class="ph wide" aria-hidden="true"><b>Series still<br/>16:10</b></div>
        <span class="tag">Short-form</span>
        <h3>Aao Chalein</h3>
        <p>A day in someone else's life, seen through their eyes. Just real people, real routines and the small moments that make up a life.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="show reveal">
        <div class="ph wide" aria-hidden="true"><b>Series still<br/>16:10</b></div>
        <span class="tag">Short-form</span>
        <h3>Tumhari Meri Baatein</h3>
        <p>Two people. One bench. An epic love story. From couples who've spent decades together to those still figuring it out, relationships unfold through conversation, laughter and silence.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="show reveal d1">
        <div class="ph wide" aria-hidden="true"><b>Series still<br/>16:10</b></div>
        <span class="tag">Short-form</span>
        <h3>Take Me Home</h3>
        <p>We ask a stranger one question: "Can you take us home?" What follows is a look inside their space — and the story of how they found it, built it and made it theirs.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

